// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : data/scripts/SpawnDefs/N_City_00_01/_src/N_City_00_01_Tutorial.xls 	Sheet : Dialog_Blue_Spectrum 
//
// Script      : Xlstospawndef.bat 
// Version     : 38 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Script Variable Greeting :
"P856364347" ""

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - NewFields 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3131641792" "Thanks for the hand! I'll stay here, do what I can to hold the Shivans back, Longbow needs your help up ahead!<br><br>Galaxy's lost, but there's still something we can do for whoever is left in here."
// Answer Text :
"P645389819" "Alright, I'll handle the rest."
// Answer Text :
"P2422181255" "Do you know what's left? Of Galaxy?"
// Page WhatsLeft Text :
"P231607028" "No, most of it is lost from what I heard.<br><br>Longbow's coordinating with Vanguard to get people out through rescue helicopters; Vanguard jets are trying to shoot down any more incoming meteors to clear a path for the helicopters.<br><br>There's not much else we can do here to save the city, we just need to save as many people as we can!"
// Answer Text :
"P2504259471" "Right, I'm off then!"
// DisplayName for BlueSpectrum :
"P993341799" "Blue Spectrum"

