"P1020623466" "Urgh..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DeadHellion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1260463214" "<color orange>You see a member of Arachnos lying dead in the street. There is a small device in his hand.<br><br>You inspect it and see the following message...<br><br>'Computer installed in Atlas. Burnout has access to it with his gang. I've set up a link to the main Arachnos network for our operatives to use.'"
// Answer Text :
"P2385719541" "(Leave)"
// DisplayName for N_DeadArachnos :
"P3363969816" "Dead Arachnos Operative"

