// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Script Variable Greeting :
// Script Variable OutLoudInfoText :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DeadKuzmin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page NothingDone Text :
"P275519171" "<color orange>You see a man dressed in some sort of gang uniform. The man looks like he was smashed by one of the Shivan monsters.<br><br>His eyes remain open, even in death.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P2048067506" "(Leave the man be)"
// Answer Text :
"P3365128226" "(Steal his wallet)"
// Answer Text :
"P2757607227" "(Close his eyes)"
// Page WalletStolen Text :
"P2838098974" "<color orange>You see a man dressed in some sort of paramilitary uniform. The man looks like he was smashed by one of the Shivan monsters. His eyes remain open, even in death.</color>"
// Page EyesClosed Text :
"P2398699373" "<color orange>You see a man dressed in some sort of paramilitary uniform. The man looks like he was smashed by one of the Shivan monsters.</color>"
// Page WalletSteal Text :
"P2809890225" "<color orange>You steal the man's wallet. He has some money on him and a few credit cards. He has a Rhode Island driver's license. You see the man's name was Boris Kuzmin.</color>"
// Answer Text :
// Page EyesClose Text :
"P3303516712" "<color orange>You close the man's eyes. Even if he was just another member of a gang, his body deserves at least some sort of peace in this carnage.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"
// DisplayName for N_DeadArachnos :
"P2177205801" "Dead Warrior"

