"P3923744348" "<color orange>You see yet another casualty from the Shivan attack.<br><br>You examine the man and find a badge identifying him as a scientist from <color yellow>SERAPH</color>.<br><br><color orange>There is a piece of paper in his hands with the words, 'Tell the others'.</color>"
// Answer Text :
// DisplayName for N_DeadArachnos :
"P3683766817" "Dead Scientist"

