// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : data/scripts/SpawnDefs/N_City_00_01/_src/N_City_00_01_Tutorial.xls 	Sheet : Dialog_Doctor_Weber 
//
// Script      : Xlstospawndef.bat 
// Version     : 38 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Script Variable Greeting :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - NewFields 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2120113949" "<color orange>The man in front of you seems to be studying one of the meteors.</color><br><br>Fascinating... these meteors are more advanced than the previous ones that crash landed in <color yellow>Bloody Bay</color>.<br><br>This can lead to a new breakthrough in my research..."
// Answer Text :
"P4123033393" "You're researching the meteors?"
// Answer Text :
// Page MeteorsResearch Text :
"P3238136708" "In a way, yes. The odd glowing substance in there could be used for... many purposes.<br><br>My name is <color yellow>Dr. Weber</color>, perhaps when we all return to Mercy, you would be interested in helping me with my experiments?"
// Answer Text :
"P2538779596" "Hrm, I suppose I could spare some time."
// Answer Text :
"P25183663" "I'm not interested in doing someone else's dirty work, doctor."
// Page SpareSomeTime Text :
"P4093245081" "Excellent. When I have everything prepared, I shall contact you."
// Answer Text :
"P843189119" "Sounds good. (Leave)"
// Page DirtyWork Text :
"P3994767241" "Fair enough. We all have our own goals and agendas. Perhaps we will still meet again back in the pools of Mercy."
// Answer Text :
"P2496721754" "Maybe. (Leave)"
// DisplayName for N_DeadArachnos :
"P613835953" "Scientist"

