// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : data/scripts/SpawnDefs/N_City_00_01/_src/N_City_00_01_Tutorial.xls 	Sheet : Dialog_FireWire 
//
// Script      : Xlstospawndef.bat 
// Version     : 38 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Script Variable Greeting :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - NewFields 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1905190870" "Sup? Name's <color yellow>Fire Wire</color>. Crazy stuff going down here, huh? But you and me, we're survivors. We're the baddest of the bad! Arachnos is gonna make us BIG, you know?!<br><br>Heh, you might even say you and me got something in common now."
// Answer Text :
"P751034534" "If you want to rely on Arachnos, be my guest."
// Answer Text :
"P3743092000" "We don't have anything in common, now back off."
// Answer Text :
"P877773779" "You bet we're the best. See you back in the Isles."
// Answer Text :
// Page BeMyGuest Text :
"P2544818760" "Hrmph... I didn't mean it... <i>whatever</i>! I can handle myself, buzz off!"
// Answer Text :
"P3800933966" "Hrmph. (Leave)"
// Page NothingInCommon Text :
"P920280953" "You think you're better than me?! Pah! You're just lucky I ain't gonna throw down with you here.<br><br>Me and my fire artifact are just fine knowin' that you and me got nothin' in common."
// Answer Text :
"P1615636822" "Whatever. (Leave)"
// Page Isles Text :
"P192312098" "Hah, yeah! Can't wait to get myself lifted over there, it's gonna be <i>great</i>, gonna be able to do <i>whatever</i> we want!"
// Answer Text :
"P797130709" "Sure will be. (Leave)"
// DisplayName for N_DeadArachnos :
"P3368194945" "Well Dressed Man"

