// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : data/scripts/SpawnDefs/N_City_00_01/_src/N_City_00_01_Tutorial.xls 	Sheet : Dialog_OfficerNelson 
//
// Script      : Xlstospawndef.bat 
// Version     : 38 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Script Variable Greeting :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - NewFields 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1795770387" "Hey... you're a hero, right? I could tell! This entire place is a war zone. I can't believe this is all happening!<br><br>This was my <i>first</i> day on the job, can you believe that? I wanted some excitement, but nothing like this!<br><br>Now... Er, you might want to stay away from me. I'm... sort of prone... to hurling...."
// Answer Text :
"P1968475364" "(Back away from the sick officer)"
// DisplayName for N_DeadArachnos :
"P3407355608" "PPD Recruit"

