// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : data/scripts/SpawnDefs/N_City_00_01/_src/N_City_00_01_Tutorial.xls 	Sheet : Dialog_ScaredHarris 
//
// Script      : Xlstospawndef.bat 
// Version     : 38 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Script Variable Greeting :
// Script Variable OutLoudInfoText :
"P2648518992" "It's over... we can't win, not like this!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - ScaredHarris 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page BlankIntro Text :
"P3883164412" "Everything is done for... Galaxy City is destroyed... the woman that I love ran off with another man...<br><br>The life of <color yellow>James Harris</color> is not worth living any more!"
// Answer Text :
"P2304000916" "(Leave the man to his mutterings)"
// Answer Text :
"P103865748" "You need to get yourself together, people need your help!"
// Answer Text :
"P4210803572" "You need to live, even if it's just to get revenge on the woman who broke your heart!"
// Page RevengeIntro Text :
"P401177092" "<color orange>James Harris seems to be consumed by the thought of revenge against his former lover. Hopefully he'll have the sense to actually get out of Galaxy City!</color>"
// Answer Text :
// Page PeopleNeedHelp Text :
"P1255571289" "Just leave me be! People don't need my help, I can't even help myself!<br><br><color orange>The man seems to be almost impossible to speak with.</color>"
// Page Revenge Text :
"P811713772" "Revenge...? Yes, revenge. I had been thinking about it... but <i>revenge</i> is something to live for! Oh, I won't forget your face, you've given me something to live for again!"
// Answer Text :
"P2943815113" "Good, now I'm getting out of here!"
// DisplayName for N_DeadArachnos :
"P2892278502" "Scared Longbow Soldier"

